1
00:01:52,135 --> 00:01:56,802
「在风儿吹拂中,爱丽克丝听到了最后一个问题。」
And on the wind Alyx heard one more question

2
00:01:58,260 --> 00:02:00,385
「你...是什么?」
"What.. are you?"

3
00:02:10,677 --> 00:02:13,677
我爱你们 爱你们的一切
I love you. Just the way you are.

4
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:19,510
直到永远
Always.

5
00:02:31,385 --> 00:02:34,260
大晚上的跑去出任务可不像你啊
It's not like you to rush off on a mission in the middle of the night.

6
00:02:35,510 --> 00:02:38,885
你也知道奥兹平是怎么的 总是神秘兮兮的
You know how Ozpin gets. Mystery after mystery.

7
00:02:39,052 --> 00:02:43,135
当原来又双是平平无奇的巡逻的时候 他又会说
And when it turns out to be yet another run-of-the-mill-patrol, it'll be

8
00:02:43,177 --> 00:02:45,510
「我一向喜欢低调行事」
"I always preferred discretion."

9
00:02:50,552 --> 00:02:51,635
我去去就回
I'll be back soon.

10
00:02:55,468 --> 00:02:56,468
我知道
I know.

11
00:03:03,802 --> 00:03:05,302
没有人起疑吧?
Nobody suspects anything?

12
00:03:05,885 --> 00:03:08,677
没有 他们以为只是平常任务
No. they think it's a typical mission.

13
00:03:09,510 --> 00:03:13,843
Summer Rose 也会说谎 真是一切皆有可能
Summer Rose telling lies. First time for everything.

14
00:03:16,843 --> 00:03:19,677
还有 她们...
And uh, what about...

15
00:03:20,593 --> 00:03:22,510
你打算…就这样丢下她们吗?
you're just... going to leave them?

16
00:03:22,635 --> 00:03:23,760
你也有脸说
You're one to talk.

17
00:03:24,343 --> 00:03:27,760
那是... 那是你更适合过那种生活
It's... you're better at that life.

18
00:03:28,302 --> 00:03:29,343
比我适合多了
Better than I was.

19
00:03:29,635 --> 00:03:32,843
如果我顺利的话 那就没什么好担心的
If I do this right, there's nothing to worry about.

20
00:03:33,927 --> 00:03:34,802
相信我
Trust me.

21
00:03:36,135 --> 00:03:38,093
还是快点搞定吧
Let's get it over with I guess.

22
00:03:45,218 --> 00:03:47,552
刚才.那是什么?
What... what was that?

23
00:03:47,927 --> 00:03:50,260
她...她骗了我们
She... she lied.

24
00:03:51,677 --> 00:03:53,427
她跟蕾玟跑了 为什么她要...
She left with Raven, why would she-

25
00:03:53,552 --> 00:03:56,552
谁知道人们为什么会隐瞒呢
Who knows why people keeps the secrets they do.

26
00:03:57,302 --> 00:04:01,802
也许你并不是唯一一个感受到他人期望的重担的人
Maybe you're not the only one who has felt the weight of others' expectations.

27
00:04:02,302 --> 00:04:05,218
就像爱丽克丝 或者令堂
Like Alyx. Like your mother.

28
00:04:13,052 --> 00:04:15,343
你是想告诉我这都是没用的吗?
Are you just trying to tell me that it's useless?

29
00:04:16,260 --> 00:04:17,593
我连试一试都不该试?
That I shouldn't even try?

30
00:04:18,593 --> 00:04:22,052
这就是这一切的寓意吗?就...开摆好了?
Is that the big lesson I'm supposed to learn? Just... give up?

31
00:04:24,593 --> 00:04:26,093
变成某个别的人?
Become someone else?

32
00:04:26,718 --> 00:04:28,843
我是这个意思吗?
Is that what I'm telling you?

33
00:04:33,552 --> 00:04:35,052
你从来都沒成为英雄
You never were the hero.

34
00:04:37,385 --> 00:04:38,135
爱丽克丝..
Alyx...

35
00:04:38,385 --> 00:04:40,510
你没能拯救我
You couldn't save me.

36
00:04:40,843 --> 00:04:44,552
我 没能拯救很多人
I... couldn't save a lot of people.

37
00:04:45,093 --> 00:04:47,218
也许需要改变一下了
Maybe it's time for a change.

38
00:04:47,718 --> 00:04:50,718
变成你最想成为的人
To be the kind of man you've always wanted to be.

39
00:05:30,635 --> 00:05:34,385
那些树叶! 快烧树叶!
The leaves! Burn the leaves!

40
00:05:45,177 --> 00:05:48,552
以猫之道还施猫身是吧
Taking a page out of the cat's note book, hhm?

41
00:05:50,677 --> 00:05:53,052
叶子对我不管用的
The leaves have no effect on me.

42
00:05:53,343 --> 00:05:56,718
也许吧 但是对妮奥就不同了
Maybe not. That's not the case for Neo.

43
00:06:01,635 --> 00:06:06,510
不!这些悔恨!这种感觉!
No! These regrets! These feelings!

44
00:06:07,010 --> 00:06:09,927
我不要 我不行!
I can't! I can't!

45
00:06:34,635 --> 00:06:36,635
剩下的时间不多了
Your time is running out.

46
00:06:38,302 --> 00:06:39,885
你必须做出选择
You must choose.

47
00:06:41,468 --> 00:06:45,468
选择成为能拋下重担的人...
Choose for youself one who could leave your burdens behind...

48
00:06:47,593 --> 00:06:51,802
或者选择成为足以背负重担的人
or choose one who would be enough to bear them.

49
00:07:19,843 --> 00:07:23,260
我爱你 我爱你的一切
I love you. Just the way you are.

50
00:07:33,135 --> 00:07:34,177
我选这个
This one.

51
00:07:35,343 --> 00:07:39,593
如果我选.. 自己呢?
What happens... if I choose me?

52
00:07:40,510 --> 00:07:41,802
那么也许
Then maybe...

53
00:07:41,885 --> 00:07:43,302
那个女孩就足够了
that girl is enough.

54
00:08:17,927 --> 00:08:18,885
Ruby!
Ruby!

55
00:08:19,010 --> 00:08:20,718
你 你还是自己!
You're... you're you!

56
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:21,302
怎么做到的?
How?

57
00:08:22,968 --> 00:08:26,135
她一直都懂... 自己想要... 成为怎样的人
She knew... what she needed to be... all along.

58
00:08:28,593 --> 00:08:32,343
真方便!
How perfect!

59
00:09:19,635 --> 00:09:21,052
你明明是坏掉的!
You're broken!

60
00:09:21,468 --> 00:09:24,385
你接触的一切都被你破坏掉!
You break everything you touch!

61
00:09:25,010 --> 00:09:26,802
就像其他人类一样
Like all humans.

62
00:09:27,385 --> 00:09:33,052
软弱 懵懂 残缺!
Weak. Confused. Incomplete!

63
00:09:33,093 --> 00:09:34,802
你错了 没有这种事
No, you're wrong.

64
00:09:34,843 --> 00:09:36,677
她根本沒有你说的任何一样特质
She's never been any of those things.

65
00:09:36,802 --> 00:09:38,468
所以我们才跟随她
That's why we follow her.

66
00:09:39,635 --> 00:09:41,052
我们要回树不子去
We're going to Remnant!

67
00:09:41,635 --> 00:09:43,177
而你会留在这里
And you're staying here.

68
00:09:49,760 --> 00:09:51,218
你不要 不要过来啊
No, nono..

69
00:09:51,635 --> 00:09:53,927
不要啊!
NO!

70
00:10:12,135 --> 00:10:16,468
他们所拥有的这些... 真好啊 是吧?
To have what they have... what a thing, huh?

71
00:10:26,885 --> 00:10:29,135
那么 我们也是时候了?
So, that's it then?

72
00:10:36,843 --> 00:10:40,468
嗯 我懂的 我不是真的
Yeah, I know. I'm not real.

73
00:10:46,093 --> 00:10:47,135
她怎么办?
What about her?

74
00:10:56,135 --> 00:11:00,927
她会找回自我的 不管是怎样的自我
She'll find herself. One way or another.

75
00:11:19,177 --> 00:11:21,343
Ruby 有什么问题吗
Ruby? What's wrong?

76
00:11:23,177 --> 00:11:27,302
我在大树里面的时候... 小小没有出现过
When I was in the tree... I never saw Little.

77
00:11:29,218 --> 00:11:30,760
我很想跟他道谢
I wish I could say thank you.

78
00:11:32,343 --> 00:11:33,677
你们觉得
Do you guys think.

79
00:11:33,927 --> 00:11:37,427
有没有可能 我们令永恒仙境的情况变得更糟了?
we might have made things even worse in the Ever After?

80
00:11:38,052 --> 00:11:39,385
正如爱丽克丝那样?
Just like Alyx did?

81
00:11:41,177 --> 00:11:42,968
我 我也不肯定
I'm. not sure.

82
00:11:44,177 --> 00:11:47,093
我想我们至少做了一点小小的好事吧?
I'd like to think that we did at least a little good?

83
00:11:48,635 --> 00:11:49,010
对吧?
Right?

84
00:11:50,343 --> 00:11:51,052
等一下!
Wait!

85
00:11:57,468 --> 00:11:58,260
小小!
Little!

86
00:11:59,093 --> 00:12:01,052
我认识你吗?
Do I know you?

87
00:12:01,718 --> 00:12:05,135
啊 这 我们好像还没见过面
Oh, uh, I don't believe we've met yet.

88
00:12:05,885 --> 00:12:07,718
请问 你是什么
Please, what are you?

89
00:12:08,677 --> 00:12:09,135
我是...
I'm...

90
00:12:10,052 --> 00:12:13,052
这个 其实 我还没想清楚
well, you know, I haven't thought about it yet.

91
00:12:13,593 --> 00:12:15,677
你看起来脑袋还挺灵光的
You look like you have your wits about you.

92
00:12:16,052 --> 00:12:17,343
你觉得我是什么
What do you think Iam?

93
00:12:17,968 --> 00:12:19,343
我觉得...
Well, uh...

94
00:12:19,843 --> 00:12:22,843
对我来说你是一个朋友
To me you seem like a friend

95
00:12:23,177 --> 00:12:23,718
一位向导
A guide.

96
00:12:24,135 --> 00:12:25,093
一名保护者
A protector.

97
00:12:25,302 --> 00:12:27,177
一..只小可爱!
A...dorable!

98
00:12:29,385 --> 00:12:31,010
这些都有说中吗
Do any of those sound close?

99
00:12:32,052 --> 00:12:34,843
嗯 有点吧...?
Hmm, somewhat..?

100
00:12:35,802 --> 00:12:37,635
对了「有点」
Yeah, Somewhat

101
00:12:38,385 --> 00:12:42,010
我可不只是某一种东西 我是很多东西的一点点!
I'm not any one thing. I'm somewhat of a lot of things!

102
00:12:42,718 --> 00:12:45,718
很高兴认识你 有点
It is a true pleasure to meet you, Somewhat.

103
00:12:46,427 --> 00:12:48,885
很荣幸能为你服务
It will be my honor to serve you.

104
00:12:50,343 --> 00:12:52,843
你已经比你想象中做的多很多了
You've already done more for us than you know.

105
00:12:57,510 --> 00:13:00,218
你确实有点... 熟悉
You do feel... familiar.

106
00:13:01,260 --> 00:13:03,677
好像一场我记不起来的美梦
Like a happy dream I can't remember.

107
00:13:04,510 --> 00:13:07,218
能遇到你我很高兴
I'm so glad we got to meet you.

108
00:13:08,302 --> 00:13:10,177
我肯定你会帮到很多的人的
I'm sure you will help lots of people.

109
00:13:11,760 --> 00:13:13,510
但是我们该道别了
But now we have to say goodbye.

110
00:13:17,177 --> 00:13:19,385
一切都会没事的 猎人
It will be alright, Huntress.

111
00:13:23,843 --> 00:13:25,385
喂 有点?
Hey. Somewhat?

112
00:13:29,510 --> 00:13:31,135
随时为你效劳!
I'm at your service!

113
00:13:32,760 --> 00:13:34,218
你能代我照顾朱尼帕吗
Would you look after Juniper?

114
00:13:34,968 --> 00:13:36,510
牠对我太重要了
She means the world to me.

115
00:13:40,302 --> 00:13:42,468
我一定会不离不弃地陪伴牠
I will never leave her side.

116
00:14:16,802 --> 00:14:19,427
啊啊啊啊!
Ahhhh!

117
00:14:45,802 --> 00:14:50,510
欢迎来到我的工作间
Welcome to my workshop.

118
00:14:52,552 --> 00:14:58,010
呃 Ruby 这就是圣树吗?
Umm Ruby, is this the Tree?

119
00:14:58,677 --> 00:14:59,927
差不多算是吧
Something like that.

120
00:15:04,802 --> 00:15:08,052
我等你很久了
I've been waiting a long time for you.

121
00:15:09,927 --> 00:15:12,635
啊 我成功抵达了
Well, I made it.

122
00:15:13,635 --> 00:15:15,135
我很欣慰
I'm glad you did.

123
00:15:17,510 --> 00:15:20,593
您能回答我一个问题吗?
Can you answer a question for me?

124
00:15:21,593 --> 00:15:23,718
我想知道 那只猫说的是不是真的..
I need to know if it's true, what the cat said...

125
00:15:23,760 --> 00:15:26,385
是不是只有路易斯回去了 而爱丽克丝.
That Lewis went back and Alyx...

126
00:15:27,552 --> 00:15:31,052
是的 只有路易斯回了家
Yes, only Lewis returned home.

127
00:15:32,093 --> 00:15:36,968
‘坠入仙境世界的女孩’的故事是他所希望的样子
'The Girl Who Fell Through The World', is the story as he wished it had happened.

128
00:15:39,177 --> 00:15:40,843
那些是...
Are those...

129
00:15:41,302 --> 00:15:42,427
兄弟神
The brothers.

130
00:15:44,760 --> 00:15:49,052
是的 这对兄弟是圣树最早的产物
Yes, these brothers were The Tree's earliest blossoms.

131
00:15:49,260 --> 00:15:52,052
也是永恒仙境最初的居民
And the first to inhabit the Ever After.

132
00:15:52,760 --> 00:15:56,177
他们非常出色 非常有野心
Remarkable beings, very ambitious.

133
00:15:56,552 --> 00:15:59,385
圣树并不知道他们后来会成为什么样
The Tree did not foresee what they would become.

134
00:16:00,510 --> 00:16:02,802
但创造的快乐就是这样
But that is the joy of creating.

135
00:16:03,593 --> 00:16:04,802
就是未知
The not-knowing.

136
00:16:09,510 --> 00:16:13,010
曾经的永恒仙境杂草丛生
Back then, the Ever After was over grown.

137
00:16:13,177 --> 00:16:15,052
狂乱又危险
Wild and dangerous.

138
00:16:16,260 --> 00:16:18,468
两兄弟的存在也是为了驯服这片土地
The brothers were meant to help tame it.

139
00:16:19,135 --> 00:16:21,843
并建造出之后出现的这个世界
And build the world that was to come after.

140
00:16:23,843 --> 00:16:26,677
最初 他们被赋予了破坏的能力
First, they were given the power to destroy.

141
00:16:27,218 --> 00:16:29,343
用来除掉这里的杂乱
To clear the wilderness away.

142
00:16:30,843 --> 00:16:33,010
然后他们被赋予了创造力
Then they were given creativity.

143
00:16:34,343 --> 00:16:40,510
用于想象着之后要用‘什么’与‘谁’来接手不再混乱的世界
To imagine what and who could replace the wilderness.

144
00:16:41,843 --> 00:16:43,802
他们为自己的造物制作了家园
The brothers built homes for them.

145
00:16:45,843 --> 00:16:47,885
也赋予了他们身份
And gave them roles to play.

146
00:16:49,260 --> 00:16:55,010
如果这是他们原本存在的意义 那树不子又是怎么来的? 我们呢?
If this is what they were supposed to do, how did Remnant come about? Us?

147
00:16:58,510 --> 00:17:00,468
两兄弟变得越发好奇
The brothers grew curious.

148
00:17:00,885 --> 00:17:02,635
他们想要做更多的事
They wanted to do more.

149
00:17:07,843 --> 00:17:15,802
所以 他们利用他们被赋予的能力 开始创造属于他们自己的生物
And so, using the skills and tools they had been given, they began to design their own creations.

150
00:17:16,510 --> 00:17:18,468
一切都在秘密进行
In utmost secrecy.

151
00:17:22,510 --> 00:17:27,885
很快他们便发现了 他们的新造物可以替他们完成工作
Soon they realized, their new creation could do their job for them.

152
00:17:29,802 --> 00:17:32,510
它可以替他们寻找永恒仙境中破碎的零件
Finding the broken parts of the Ever After.

153
00:17:38,385 --> 00:17:43,302
在这次的成功后 两兄弟创造了第二个生物
After this success, the brothers designed a second creature.

154
00:17:43,343 --> 00:17:45,593
用来结束猫所开始的一切
To finish what the cat started.

155
00:17:46,760 --> 00:17:50,968
那生物非常残暴 也非常有效
It came out brutal, and effective.

156
00:17:55,552 --> 00:17:59,260
其中一个兄弟觉得他们毁坏了世界的平衡
One brother believed they had disrupted the balance.

157
00:18:00,010 --> 00:18:04,135
另一个却拒绝让他们的造物为自己的错误接受处罚
While the other refused to condemn their creations for their mistakes.

158
00:18:05,468 --> 00:18:08,718
但平衡并不是两股势力被困在一场永恒的战争里
But balance is not two forces locked in never ending battle.

159
00:18:10,218 --> 00:18:16,468
平衡是一种生态 是一个生物 它是有气息的活物
Balance is an ecosystem, an organism, a living breathing thing.

160
00:18:17,260 --> 00:18:21,760
所以平衡无法用蛮力或算计来维持
Thus balance cannot be restored with force or calculation.

161
00:18:22,260 --> 00:18:25,843
真正的平衡会找到自己
True balance finds its own equilibrium

162
00:18:27,010 --> 00:18:33,135
它所需的只有爱 与静待到最后的耐心
It only requires love and the patience to see things through to the end.

163
00:18:37,177 --> 00:18:39,677
所以 他们是怎么去到树不子的?
So, how did they get to Remnant?

164
00:18:41,010 --> 00:18:44,385
永恒仙境已经无法承受两兄弟的实验了
The Ever After could no longer bear the brothers' experiments.

165
00:18:44,885 --> 00:18:49,760
所以 圣树为他们制作了一扇特殊的门 带领他们去到更广阔的远方
And so, The Tree built them a special door to a greater beyond.

166
00:18:50,177 --> 00:18:53,718
在那里 他们可以创造他们所想要的世界
Where the brothers could try creating worlds of their own.

167
00:18:55,135 --> 00:19:01,260
一扇永远为他们与他们的造物所敞开的大门
A door way that would remain open for the brothers' return, and any of their creations.

168
00:19:02,385 --> 00:19:09,302
每次有两兄弟的造物出现时 他们的行动总是如此卓越
And what truly remarkable things they accomplished, whenever the brothers' creations had come to The Ever After!

169
00:19:10,427 --> 00:19:14,218
你们五个对与永恒仙境的影响超出了你们自己的想象
The five of you have had a greater impact than you know.

170
00:19:14,760 --> 00:19:17,427
就像你们之前的爱丽克丝与路易斯
Just like Alyx and Lewis did, before you.

171
00:19:18,427 --> 00:19:20,552
以及在你们之后的其他事物
Just like others will, after you.

172
00:19:22,843 --> 00:19:31,760
一次小小的善意之举 一些无足轻重的瞬间 带来了如此美妙的造化
One small kindness, in one small moment, led to such a marvelous transformation.

173
00:19:35,927 --> 00:19:42,510
就像一个不诚实的举动 也会带来不幸的改变
Much like one act of dishonesty, çaused an unfortunate change.

174
00:19:42,593 --> 00:19:44,343
爱丽克丝没有实现她对猫的承诺
Alyx broke her promise to the cat.

175
00:19:45,802 --> 00:19:48,885
有着一颗破碎的心灵是件非常糟糕的事
A terrible thing, to have a broken heart.

176
00:19:49,927 --> 00:19:53,718
而且 没有人把猫送回圣树去修复
And there was nobody to send them back to The Tree for repair.

177
00:19:55,093 --> 00:19:56,468
妮奥会怎么样?
What will happen to Neo?

178
00:19:57,510 --> 00:20:00,302
她将有机会归还她破损的内心
She will have the chance to return her broken heart.

179
00:20:02,552 --> 00:20:04,427
并成为新的事物
And become something new.

180
00:20:05,927 --> 00:20:07,885
这 就是平衡
Such is balance.

181
00:20:09,177 --> 00:20:10,552
那是爱丽克丝的刀
That's Alyx's knife.

182
00:20:11,052 --> 00:20:12,635
您怎么会有这把刀?
Wait, how do you have this?

183
00:20:13,677 --> 00:20:18,927
当爱丽克丝走到生命尽头时 她选择留下了自己的一部分
When Alyx's life ended, she chose to leave a part of herself behind.

184
00:20:19,552 --> 00:20:22,635
一个愿望 希望能够修复因她而被破坏的心
A wish to fix what she had broken.

185
00:20:36,093 --> 00:20:38,468
真难以置信
I can't believe it.

186
00:20:39,260 --> 00:20:40,760
已经过了太久...
It's been so...

187
00:20:41,885 --> 00:20:44,718
我 我的声音原本是这样的吗?
This... is what I sounded like?

188
00:20:51,802 --> 00:20:53,135
它会带我们去哪?
Where will this take us?

189
00:20:54,427 --> 00:21:00,135
不是「哪」而是「何时」最需要你们
Not 'where', 'when' you are needed most.

190
00:21:12,343 --> 00:21:13,468
谢谢
Thank you.